hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1426","Muhammad ibn al-Walid narrated to us, Abu Asim narrated to us, Thawab ibn Utba narrated to us, Ibn Buraidah narrated to us, on the authority of his father, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, narrated to us He said: “He would not go out on the Day of Breakfast until he had eaten food, and he would not go out on the Day of Sacrifice until he had slaughtered.”"
